<title>UK: Sainsbury up after JP Morgan comment.</title>
<headline>Sainsbury up after JP Morgan comment.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in J Sainsbury Plc rose on Monday after a report in Barron's said the stock was included in a list of five preferred London stocks by the chairman of JP Morgan Investment Management's global strategy committee.</p>
<p>Sainsbury was 8p at 362 by 1510 GMT in volume of 1.8 million shares.</p>
<p>Others on the list included Amersham International Plc, up 10p at 11.52-1/2 stg and HSBC Holdings Plc, up 10-1/2p at 12.43 stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 5106</p>
